{"step_index":79,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T06:32:06Z","content":"**Yes, exactly! That is the first page.**\n\nBecause this is your first time opening the app, your browser's local IndexedDB doesn't have a vault yet. \n\n### What to do on this screen:\n\n1. **Enter a Master Password** (at least 8 characters).\n2. **Re-enter it** in the *Confirm Master Password* box.\n3. Click **\"Create Secure Vault\"**.\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Make sure to remember this master password, as it is used to locally derive your AES-256 encryption key. \n\nOnce you click the button, your vault will be initialized and you will be taken straight into your **main vault dashboard** where you can start adding, searching, and generating passwords!"}
