{"step_index":87,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T06:48:19Z","thinking":"**Initiating Browser Extension Design**\n\nThe user's confirmation indicates a shift towards a browser extension approach. The primary goal remains maintaining an entirely offline password manager with local encryption. Next step involves conceptualizing the extension's architecture for a popup interface triggered by the toolbar icon. Initial design will be centered on local storage interaction.\n\n\n**Assessing Planning Mode Requirements**\n\nThe browser extension presents significant architectural changes, prompting consideration of the \"planning mode\". Creating the browser extension necessitates a plan; this involves a manifest, background service worker, UI, and message passing. The next action is to craft or update an implementation plan, request feedback, and await approval before proceeding with build and test phases.\n\n\n**Defining Browser Extension Structure**\n\nNow defining the browser extension's core elements, the manifest file establishes permissions, UI entry point, and content script injection.  Strict content security policy is crucial for maintaining an offline-first, secure architecture. The popup interface will handle vault interactions; password management, auto-fill, and generation.\n\n**Implementing Content Script Interactivity**\n\nContent script design will focus on automatically identifying username/password input fields within websites.  A visual cue will be injected into input fields, providing users an interactive pathway to autofill credentials.  This also considers strict network blocking as a core security requirement.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"Implementation plan for building a 100% offline Chrome/Edge Browser Extension with in-page auto-fill and quick-copy on websites like GitHub.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Offline Password Manager - Browser Extension Implementation Plan\\n\\nTransform the offline password manager into a native **Chrome/Edge Browser Extension (Manifest V3)** with in-page credential auto-fill and quick-copy overlays on websites like GitHub, Google, and more.\\n\\n## User Review Required\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> **Zero-Network Policy Maintained**:\\n> The extension will continue to enforce `connect-src 'none'` in its extension Content Security Policy. No network calls, telemetry, or external API connections will be allowed. All AES-256 encryption and storage remain 100% local inside the browser extension sandbox (`chrome.storage.local`).\\n\\n> [!NOTE]\\n> **Easy Loading in Chrome / Edge**:\\n> Chrome and Edge allow loading local extensions with one click via `chrome://extensions` > \\\"Developer mode\\\" > **\\\"Load unpacked\\\"**. No Web Store approval or purchase is necessary.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Architecture & Workflows\\n\\n```mermaid\\ngraph TD\\n    subgraph Browser Extension Sandbox\\n        Popup[Toolbar Popup UI] --> Crypto[Web Crypto API AES-GCM]\\n        Crypto --> Storage[(chrome.storage.local)]\\n        Background[background.js Service Worker] --> Storage\\n    end\\n\\n    subgraph Web Page (e.g. GitHub)\\n        ContentScript[content.js Injected Script]\\n        Inputs[Login & Password Inputs]\\n        OverlayUI[Floating Shield / Autofill Dropdown]\\n    end\\n\\n    Inputs -->|Focus/Click| ContentScript\\n    ContentScript -->|chrome.runtime.sendMessage| Background\\n    Background -->|Get matching domain creds| ContentScript\\n    ContentScript -->|Render popup badge| OverlayUI\\n    OverlayUI -->|Click 'Auto-Fill' or 'Copy'| Inputs\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Proposed Changes\\n\\nWe will build the extension in a dedicated directory:\\n`C:\\\\Users\\\\vijay\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\offline-vault-extension`\\n\\n### 1. Extension Manifest & Core Configuration\\n\\n#### [NEW] `manifest.json`\\n- Manifest V3 compliant.\\n- Permissions: `[\\\"storage\\\", \\\"activeTab\\\", \\\"scripting\\\"]`.\\n- Host permissions: `[\\\"<all_urls>\\\"]` (needed to detect \n<truncated 3367 bytes>","Description":"\"Create implementation plan for the Chrome/Edge offline password manager extension\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\vijay\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\0fddf4ef-d93f-406e-8ec9-d51e8406f759\\\\implementation_plan.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing extension implementation plan\"","toolSummary":"\"Create extension plan\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
