{"step_index":91,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T06:50:30Z","thinking":"**Initiating Extension Development**\n\nWith the implementation plan approved, the Chrome/Edge extension construction begins. Essential files, including the manifest, icons, cryptography utilities utilizing the Web Crypto API, and storage mechanisms, are now the focus. The project is located in the dedicated extension directory.\n\n\n**Defining Extension Manifest**\n\nInitial focus is the `manifest.json` file, crucial for defining extension metadata and capabilities.  Verification against the specifications ensures compatibility. Necessary keys for versioning, user interface, background scripts, permissions, and content scripts are being considered.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"{\\n  \\\"manifest_version\\\": 3,\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"Offline Vault - Password Manager\\\",\\n  \\\"version\\\": \\\"1.0.0\\\",\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"100% offline, zero-network password manager with AES-256 local encryption and in-page autofill.\\\",\\n  \\\"action\\\": {\\n    \\\"default_popup\\\": \\\"popup.html\\\",\\n    \\\"default_icon\\\": {\\n      \\\"16\\\": \\\"icons/icon16.png\\\",\\n      \\\"48\\\": \\\"icons/icon48.png\\\",\\n      \\\"128\\\": \\\"icons/icon128.png\\\"\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"icons\\\": {\\n    \\\"16\\\": \\\"icons/icon16.png\\\",\\n    \\\"48\\\": \\\"icons/icon48.png\\\",\\n    \\\"128\\\": \\\"icons/icon128.png\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"background\\\": {\\n    \\\"service_worker\\\": \\\"background.js\\\",\\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"module\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"permissions\\\": [\\n    \\\"storage\\\",\\n    \\\"activeTab\\\",\\n    \\\"scripting\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"host_permissions\\\": [\\n    \\\"<all_urls>\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"content_scripts\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"matches\\\": [\\\"<all_urls>\\\"],\\n      \\\"js\\\": [\\\"content.js\\\"],\\n      \\\"css\\\": [\\\"content.css\\\"],\\n      \\\"run_at\\\": \\\"document_idle\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"content_security_policy\\\": {\\n    \\\"extension_pages\\\": \\\"script-src 'self'; object-src 'self'; connect-src 'none';\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n\"","Description":"\"Create manifest.json for Manifest V3 offline password manager extension\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\vijay\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\offline-vault-extension\\\\manifest.json\"","toolAction":"\"Creating manifest.json\"","toolSummary":"\"Create manifest.json\""}}]}
