{"step_index":97,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T06:51:38Z","thinking":"**Defining background script functionality**\n\n`background.js` will hold the session master key, setting up auto-lock. The script will generate the action icon for the browser extension using an `OffscreenCanvas`. It also requires the ability to receive messages from `content.js` and `popup.js`. Specifically, this means handling requests for vault status and setting the session key.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"/**\\n * Offline Vault - Background Service Worker\\n * Coordinates in-memory crypto key, domain matching, and in-page auto-fill.\\n */\\n\\nimport { getStoredMeta, getStoredItems } from './storage.js';\\nimport { decryptPayload } from './crypto.js';\\n\\nlet sessionMasterKey = null;\\nlet autoLockTimer = null;\\nlet autoLockMinutes = 15;\\n\\n// Generate and set action icon dynamically using OffscreenCanvas\\nfunction generateBadgeIcon() {\\n  try {\\n    const canvas = new OffscreenCanvas(32, 32);\\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\\n\\n    // Background circle\\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#090d16';\\n    ctx.beginPath();\\n    ctx.arc(16, 16, 15, 0, Math.PI * 2);\\n    ctx.fill();\\n\\n    // Shield border\\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#10b981';\\n    ctx.lineWidth = 2.5;\\n    ctx.beginPath();\\n    ctx.moveTo(16, 6);\\n    ctx.lineTo(24, 9);\\n    ctx.lineTo(24, 16);\\n    ctx.quadraticCurveTo(24, 25, 16, 27);\\n    ctx.quadraticCurveTo(8, 25, 8, 16);\\n    ctx.lineTo(8, 9);\\n    ctx.closePath();\\n    ctx.stroke();\\n\\n    // Checkmark inside shield\\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#34d399';\\n    ctx.lineWidth = 2;\\n    ctx.beginPath();\\n    ctx.moveTo(12, 16);\\n    ctx.lineTo(15, 19);\\n    ctx.lineTo(20, 13);\\n    ctx.stroke();\\n\\n    const imageData = ctx.getImageData(0, 0, 32, 32);\\n    chrome.action.setIcon({ imageData });\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    console.log('Icon generation fallback');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nchrome.runtime.onInstalled.addListener(() => {\\n  generateBadgeIcon();\\n});\\n\\nchrome.runtime.onStartup.addListener(() => {\\n  generateBadgeIcon();\\n});\\n\\n// Domain normalization (e.g., \\\"https://github.com/login\\\" -> \\\"github.com\\\")\\nfunction extractDomain(url) {\\n  if (!url) return '';\\n  try {\\n    const parsed = new URL(url.startsWith('http') ? url : `https://${url}`);\\n    return parsed.hostname.replace(/^www\\\\./, '').toLowerCase();\\n  } catch (e) {\\n    return url.toLowerCase();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction resetInactivityTimer() {\\n  if (autoLockTimer) clearTimeout(autoLockTimer);\\n  if (autoLockMinutes > 0 && sessionMasterKey) {\\n    autoLockTimer = setTi\n<truncated 2629 bytes>","Description":"\"Create background service worker for extension session management and autofill matching\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\vijay\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\offline-vault-extension\\\\background.js\"","toolAction":"\"Creating background.js\"","toolSummary":"\"Create background.js\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
