{"step_index":103,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T06:52:39Z","thinking":"**Designing the extension popup interface**\n\nThe focus is on crafting the `popup.html` structure. The popup will have a compact size. Three distinct states are needed: an initial setup screen for password setup, an unlock screen with password input and a shake animation, and a dashboard view. The dashboard will feature a header that dynamically displays matching domain context, such as \"Matching on github\".\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"/* Compact Popup Styles */\\n:root {\\n  --bg-main: #090d16;\\n  --bg-card: #111827;\\n  --bg-input: #1a2234;\\n  --border-color: #26334d;\\n  --primary: #10b981;\\n  --primary-hover: #059669;\\n  --primary-light: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);\\n  --danger: #ef4444;\\n  --danger-light: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);\\n  --warning: #f59e0b;\\n  --text-primary: #f8fafc;\\n  --text-secondary: #94a3b8;\\n  --text-muted: #64748b;\\n  --radius: 8px;\\n}\\n\\n* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\\n\\nbody {\\n  width: 360px;\\n  min-height: 480px;\\n  max-height: 580px;\\n  background-color: var(--bg-main);\\n  color: var(--text-primary);\\n  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, sans-serif;\\n  font-size: 13px;\\n  display: flex;\\n  flex-direction: column;\\n  overflow-x: hidden;\\n}\\n\\n/* Header */\\n.popup-header {\\n  display: flex;\\n  align-items: center;\\n  justify-content: space-between;\\n  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\\n  background: var(--bg-card);\\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\\n  position: sticky;\\n  top: 0;\\n  z-index: 20;\\n}\\n\\n.brand-wrap {\\n  display: flex;\\n  align-items: center;\\n  gap: 0.5rem;\\n  font-weight: 700;\\n  font-size: 14px;\\n}\\n\\n/* Tab Matching Banner */\\n.tab-match-banner {\\n  background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);\\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);\\n