{"step_index":107,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T06:53:18Z","thinking":"**Designing the popup script**\n\nThe `popup.js` script needs to manage the vault's state and display the appropriate UI. First, it must determine the vault's status by communicating with the background worker to check if the vault is initialized or locked. Next, the script should display the correct screen: a setup screen if uninitialized (requiring master password creation and key derivation) or an unlock screen if the vault is locked.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"/**\\n * Offline Vault - Popup Script\\n * Manages unlock, item CRUD, active tab autofill, and password generator.\\n */\\n\\nimport {\\n  deriveMasterKey,\\n  generateSalt,\\n  encryptPayload,\\n  decryptPayload,\\n  CANARY_SECRET,\\n  generateSecurePassword,\\n  evaluateStrength\\n} from './crypto.js';\\n\\nimport {\\n  getStoredMeta,\\n  setStoredMeta,\\n  getStoredItems,\\n  saveStoredItem,\\n  deleteStoredItem\\n} from './storage.js';\\n\\nlet masterKey = null;\\nlet currentTab = null;\\nlet items = [];\\nlet searchQuery = '';\\nlet isAdding = false;\\nlet isGeneratorOpen = false;\\n\\nfunction showToast(msg) {\\n  const t = document.createElement('div');\\n  t.className = 'toast';\\n  t.textContent = msg;\\n  document.body.appendChild(t);\\n  setTimeout(() => t.remove(), 1800);\\n}\\n\\nfunction extractDomain(url) {\\n  if (!url) return '';\\n  try {\\n    const parsed = new URL(url.startsWith('http') ? url : `https://${url}`);\\n    return parsed.hostname.replace(/^www\\\\./, '').toLowerCase();\\n  } catch (e) {\\n    return url.toLowerCase();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function init() {\\n  const tabs = await chrome.tabs.query({ active: true, currentWindow: true });\\n  currentTab = tabs[0] || null;\\n\\n  const bgKeyRes = await chrome.runtime.sendMessage({ type: 'GET_SESSION_KEY' });\\n  const meta = await getStoredMeta();\\n\\n  if (!meta || !meta.salt || !meta.canary) {\\n    renderSetup();\\n    return;\\n  }\\n\\n  if (bgKeyRes && bgKeyRes.key) {\\n    masterKey = bgKeyRes.key;\\n    await loadDecryptedItems();\\n    renderDashboard();\\n  } else {\\n    renderUnlock(meta);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function loadDecryptedItems() {\\n  const encrypted = await getStoredItems();\\n  const decrypted = [];\\n\\n  for (const item of encrypted) {\\n    try {\\n      const secret = await decryptPayload(\\n        { ciphertext: item.ciphertext, iv: item.iv },\\n        masterKey\\n      );\\n      decrypted.push({\\n        id: item.id,\\n        category: item.category || 'logins',\\n        updatedAt: item.updatedAt,\\n        ...secret\\n      });\\n    } catch (e) {\\n      console.error(e);\\n    }\\n \n<truncated 15750 bytes>","Description":"\"Create popup.js with active tab matching, autofill, generator, and CRUD\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\vijay\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\offline-vault-extension\\\\popup.js\"","toolAction":"\"Creating popup.js\"","toolSummary":"\"Create popup.js\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
