{"step_index":133,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T08:20:43Z","content":"Here is how to auto-fill your email and password on **`vitvellore312.examly.io`**:\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Pin the Extension to your Toolbar (First Time)\nLook at the top right of your browser (next to your profile picture `V`):\n1. Click the **Puzzle Piece icon (🧩)**.\n2. Find **Offline Vault - Password Manager** in the list.\n3. Click the **Pin icon (📌)** next to it so the shield icon stays visible on your toolbar.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Save your Login for this Website\n1. Click the **🛡️ Offline Vault** shield icon in your toolbar.\n2. If vault is locked, type your master password to unlock.\n3. Click **`＋ Add`**:\n   - **Title**: `VIT Examly`\n   - **Username / Email**: Type your college email\n   - **Password**: Type your password\n   - **Website URL**: `examly.io` *(it will already be pre-filled!)*\n   - Click **\"Save Encrypted\"**.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Auto-Fill on this Page\nNotice that Examly has a **2-step login** (First Email, then Password):\n\n1. Click the **🛡️ Offline Vault** shield icon in your toolbar.\n2. You will see:\n   ```text\n   1 login for examly.io\n   [ ⚡ Fill on Tab ]\n   ```\n3. Click **`⚡ Fill on Tab`**:\n   - It will automatically type your email into the box!\n4. Click the blue **\"Next\"** button on Examly.\n5. When the password field appears on the next screen:\n   - Click the **🛡️ Offline Vault** icon again and click **`⚡ Fill on Tab`** (or click the green shield inside the password box).\n   - Your password will be filled automatically!","thinking":"**Interpreting Login Page Context**\n\nThe image shows a login page for \"VIT - Vellore Colab,\" located at the `examly.io` domain. The page presents an \"Email\" input field with a \"Next\" button. The browser's toolbar extensions are also visible.\n\n\n"}
